    "Pinned mode lets you release the modifier, browse with the arrow keys, type to search, press Return to open, or Escape to cancel.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "固定模式下可以松开修饰键，用方向键浏览、输入搜索、回车键打开、Esc 键取消。"
          }
